z_{i}\sim p_{\theta}(\,\cdot\mid x,y_{i}),\;i=1{:}N\end{subarray}}\Bigl[r_{\text{beh}}\bigl(x,\;\operatorname{Best}_{N}(x,z_{1{:}N})\bigr)\Bigr]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
